<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>POSH Policy</h1><p>Prevention of Sexual Harassment</p><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> POSH Policy</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
<p style="color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:32px">In compliance with the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px">Policy Statement</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Abhyaas The Global School provides a safe working environment for all employees, irrespective of gender. Sexual harassment in any form — verbal, physical, or gestural — is strictly prohibited and will result in disciplinary action including termination of employment.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Internal Complaints Committee (ICC)</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">The school has constituted an Internal Complaints Committee (ICC) as mandated by the Act. The ICC comprises a presiding officer (senior female employee), two members from staff, and an external member from an NGO or legal background.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Filing a Complaint</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Any aggrieved employee may file a written complaint with the ICC within 3 months of the incident. The committee will conduct an inquiry and submit a report within 60 days. Complaints may also be submitted confidentially to the school principal.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Awareness &amp; Training</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">The school conducts annual POSH awareness workshops for all staff. New employees are briefed on this policy during orientation.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9">For queries or to reach the ICC, write to <a href="mailto:<%= school.email %>" style="color:var(--green)"><%= school.email %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
